#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:155
#: 2532c7f312874cdd91bee6139ff373a0
msgid ":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 90 (EKF Pos Source) to allow the pilot to use channel 6 to switch between Source1 (e.g. GPS+Compass) and Source2 (e.g. VOXL camera).  The switch's low position is Source1 (GPS+Compass), middle position is Source2 (e.g. VOXL), and high position is Source3 (e.g. None) which will lead to the EKF losing its position estimate and triggering an EKF failsafe.  To avoid pilot error triggering an EKF failsafe you may wish to copy EK3_SRC1_xxx or EK2_SRC2_xxx to EK3_SRC3_xx."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:156
#: 1ccc5f4ea58f4fb895f5b1c0e9c18dc6
msgid ":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 80 (Viso Align) to allow the pilot to use channel 7 to re-align the camera's yaw with the AHRS/EKF yaw before flight.  Re-aligning yaw before takeoff is a good idea or loss of position control (aka \"toilet bowling\") may occur."
msgstr ""

